### Get latest messages (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get older messages (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?beforeSeq=120&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Fill a message gap (oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?afterSeq=90&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
